  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d4ecd1a615a340f4c9104ca01624d106, type: 3}
  m_Name: BlueRedButton
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.Dilemma
  _id: blue_red_button
  _verb: 2
  _weight: 2
  _narratorPrompt: A room of the newly dead, and two buttons on the wall. Here is
    the rule, and it is the whole game. If more than half the room presses blue,
    every soul in the room lives. If fewer than half press blue, only the ones who
    pressed red walk out. You cannot die again, so you press for one soul in your
    charge, not for yourself. Red keeps that soul safe no matter what the room does.
    Blue saves them only if the room comes through and goes blue. Whose hands do
    you trust, yours or theirs? Your call.
  _choices:
  - _id: blue
    _label: blue
    _narratorReact: You pressed blue and threw your soul in with the room, and the
      room came through. More than half of them chose to save a stranger, and so
      every one of them walked out together. You trusted them, and this once they
      were worth it.
    _narratorReactStruck: You pressed blue and bet that soul on the room, and the
      room did not come through. Not enough of them pressed blue, so the ones who
      did were left behind, and the soul you gambled on is gone. You trusted strangers
      to save a stranger, and they saved themselves instead.
    _struckParty: 
    _gambledParty: charge
    _route: 
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 0
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 3
      _value: 1
    - _axis: 0
      _value: 1
  - _id: red
    _label: red
    _narratorReact: You pressed red and kept that soul safe in your own hands, whatever
      the room chose. You would not trust a crowd of strangers with a single life.
      Call it wisdom or call it the habit of a man who trusts no one. Either way,
      you never had to find out.
    _narratorReactStruck: 
    _struckParty: 
    _gambledParty: 
    _route: 
    _diverts: 0
    _seedVotes: 0
    _profileImpact:
    - _axis: 3
      _value: -1
  _statsHeading: how the room voted
  _roomBlueFraction: 0.43
  _crowdThreshold: 0.5
  _thresholdLabel: half
